  "worked_solution": "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(B-C) & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{aligned}]-([\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -4\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 6 & 3\\end{aligned}]) \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}3-1 & 5-2 \\\\ 0-6 & -4-3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 \\\\ -6 & -7\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4-2 & -2-3 \\\\ 7-(-6) & 1-(-7)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & -5 \\\\ 13 & 8\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
